{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2016-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1453593600, "end_date": 1454284799, "month_true_total": 512, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:11:05 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "20882648", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042746722", "personaname": "Kathmandu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042746722/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5152, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3486, "last_played": 1618457415, "avatar": "26a26bd21db144fbc4d261b8510c0ca2f8e99c7b"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of my favorite roguelikes, really wish the producers had more support for this game.", "timestamp_created": 1454278538, "timestamp_updated": 1454278538, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20882581", "author": {"steamid": "76561198194169783", "personaname": "SlaughterCon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198194169783/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 317, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 115, "last_played": 1638688558, "avatar": "e3ffa9f36c4e3c5d1d58a05dcc16f2ae2c26db64"}, "language": "english", "review": "What an incredible game, Risk of Rain is one of those genuinely amazing games that you only find once in a great while!  BUY THIS GAME!!", "timestamp_created": 1454278321, "timestamp_updated": 1454278321, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20880757", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042010756", "personaname": "Beans", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/d4nkfury/", "num_games_owned": 764, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 4250, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3700, "last_played": 1735962643, "avatar": "adcaee99ef5f01789accbee248d611d9419a09c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain? More like Risk of lots of fun or potentially almost ruin your day.\n\nSeriouly though, this game is a heck of a lot of fun. The only reason I say ruin your day is because there is a heavy amount of RNG involved. Items from chests and drops from enemies are all random and if you're lucky, you'll end up with a lot of great items fit for your class. If not, you aren't going to have a good time. \nHowever, this is actually what makes the game so fun because you never know what the next playthrough will be like, \ngiving the game a lot of replayability.\n\nAnd oh man the music in this game is phenomenal. There isn't a single track in this game that I didn't enjoy. Each track sounds very similar to each other, but also very different from each other. They flow together extremely well.\n\nI cannot recommend this game enough.", "timestamp_created": 1454272212, "timestamp_updated": 1454272212, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.537712931632995605", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "20871298", "author": {"steamid": "76561198077245539", "personaname": "weasel75", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198077245539/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 93, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 81, "last_played": 1454192187, "avatar": "4c347901df273b915503426967f99335ca55fec6"}, "language": "english", "review": "IIRC, the game was fun.... back then, when it ran on my (other) computer.\n\nOn my new computer I have IU-issues with the mouse. This bug is not new, it is known and documented. Yet, nobody cares. A quick glance into the discussions reveals a huge amount of bug-reports and a serious lack of interest from the developer's side.\n\nActually, I paid money to end up with a game where I can not get pass the menu-screen.\nVery frustrating.\n\nI can neither recommend this game nor the developers.", "timestamp_created": 1454244361, "timestamp_updated": 1454244548, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.436507940292358398", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20864325", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095320851", "personaname": ":^)", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/theresnothingelseavailable/", "num_games_owned": 334, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2968, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1943, "last_played": 1475024560, "avatar": "97f57b58d639bf7e7f0de30ba44f013c32281139"}, "language": "english", "review": "YOU BUY NOW", "timestamp_created": 1454216047, "timestamp_updated": 1454216047, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}